    <statement><p>Let <m>f(x) = \displaystyle{2+\frac{3}{1+(x+1)^2}}</m>.</p>
<p>Determine all critical values of <m>f</m>. If there is more than one, enter the
values as a comma-separated list.</p>
<p>Critical value(s) = <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Construct a first derivative sign chart for <m>f</m> and thus determine
